 # inventory
 
-Usage: `python -m inventory report data/stock.csv [--threshold N]`
+Usage: `python -m inventory report data/stock.csv [--threshold N] [--format text|json]`
 
 Prints one line per item sorted by SKU: `SKU  NAME  QTY` and appends ` LOW` when quantity is below the threshold (default 5).
+
+Use `--format json` for a JSON array sorted by SKU. Each object contains `sku`, `name`, integer `quantity`, and boolean `low_stock` (quantity below the threshold). The default format is `text`.
